Division-free arithmetic in Lean

Circuit.lean and Recurrence.lean are adapted from the local matmul project,
whose project additions are distributed under Apache-2.0. Source paths and
SHA-256 hashes are recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.json. The source project's
NOTICE is retained in docs/MATMUL-NOTICE.txt. No tensor, fixed-point, or
spectral modules from that project are included here.

Modifications: standalone imports, DivisionFree namespaces, compatibility
with Lean 4.32.0, and extensions described in each module and the provenance
record. New project code and tooling are distributed under Apache-2.0.
